# Quality Manager (Tests)

When editing files under `src/**/*.test.ts`:

- Follow project test style: JSDoc in English, no magic numbers (use constants), clear names (see **.cursor/rules/function-docs-and-style.mdc**).
- Run `npm run test:run` before and after changes to keep tests green.
- For the full workflow (writing tests, reviewing coverage, preventing regressions), use **.cursor/skills/quality-manager**.
